        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8452, Round Wrought Steel Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Round Wrought Steel Deadbolt looks like a traditional door lock in all respects except for in its finishing. The rustic, almost textured looking finish of this Wrought Steel Deadbolt makes this front door keyed lock look like something straight out of the old world. It is available in flat black steel and satin steel finishes. A single cylinder deadbolt, the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b>  The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Single Cylinder Wrought Steel #2 Style Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Wrought steel collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Round #2 Wrought Steel Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Wrought-Steel-finish.jpg?v=1704354509\" width=\"351\" height=\"184\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
